welfare-concerns","verified":"Inspectors may advise farmers or keepers about their legal welfare duties.","quality_score":"4","adoption":"ANIMAL_KEEPER_WELFARE_ADVICE","direct_score_input":false},{"row":173,"status":"PASS_APHA_ENFORCEMENT_SUPPORT","source":"APHA farm animal welfare reporting","url":"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/report-farm-animal-welfare-concerns","verified":"APHA may support local-authority enforcement or prosecution decisions.","quality_score":"4","adoption":"ANIMAL_WELFARE_ENFORCEMENT_SUPPORT","direct_score_input":false},{"row":174,"status":"PASS_APHA_NO_DIRECT_CPS_REFERRAL","source":"APHA farm animal welfare reporting","url":"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/report-farm-animal-welfare-concerns","verified":"APHA does not refer animal-welfare reports directly to the Crown Prosecution Service.","quality_score":"4","adoption":"APHA_PROSECUTION_BOUNDARY","direct_score_input":false},{"row":175,"status":"PASS_APHA_NOTIFIABLE_DISEASE_24_7","source":"APHA animal and plant health contacts","url":"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/get-help-with-animal-and-plant-health","verified":"Notifiable animal disease can be reported 24 hours a day, 7 days a week.","quality_score":"4","adoption":"ANIMAL_DISEASE_24_7_REPORT","direct_score_input":false},{"row":176,"status":"PASS_APHA_URGENT_NONURGENT_ROUTES","source":"APHA animal and plant health contacts","url":"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/get-help-with-animal-and-plant-health","verified":"Urgent farm-animal welfare concerns use a telephone route while non-urgent concerns use the online form.","quality_score":"4","adoption":"ANIMAL_WELFARE_URGENCY_ROUTING","direct_score_input":false},{"row":177,"status":"PASS_FSA_SLAUGHTERHOUSE_WELFARE_REPORT","source":"FSA Annual Animal Welfare Report 2025/26","url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/fsa-260608-annual-animal-welfare-report/annual-animal-welfare-report-202526","verified":"FSA published a 2025/26 report covering animal-welfare controls and enforcement in approved slaughter